# The shortcuts on a French keyboard, with GamePad (fixtures/shortcuts,
# as shortcuts.keys makes it): recorded with our Xephyr's layout French
# (setxkbmap -layout fr inside one xrun command, us given back after
# it). M, which lies where a US keyboard has its semicolon, puts the
# Meca-Pinguin down through its virtual key, which the record's k lines
# hold, and J puts the protopack on and away.

hold 0.15
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 12
shot scene
key m
sleep 4
shot pingouin
key j
sleep 3
shot protopack
key j
sleep 3
shot away
